# Store everything with LF in the repository AND check it out with LF, so the
# files are byte-identical on Windows, macOS and Linux. This is what stops Git
# printing "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every `git add` under Windows.
# Python, YAML and every modern Windows editor handle LF without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch line endings in binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
